(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Amazon on time delivery and LG installation team work. Great for me. Installation team took solid 3+ hours and did very good job on installation which is the key first step.Coming LG AC, it’s very good. Cools very fast, less noisy. Outdoor unit gold coated fins looks great.Overall I would recommend LG over other brands, though it might cost 1-1.5k more, it’s worth it.

